<section class="hero" id="hero">
    <div class="hero__text">
        <header class="hero__header">
            <h1 class="hero__name">Full Stack Software Engineer</h1>
            <div class="hero__role-row">
                <p class="hero__role">Samuel Dukes</p>
                <ThemeToggle/>
            </div>
        </header>

        <p class="hero__bio">
            Hello, my name is Sam! I’m a career switcher, taking over a decade of customer
            service and client consultation experience into the tech industry as a full stack
            developer.
        </p>

        <hr class="hero__divider"/>

        <h2 class="hero__section-heading" id="my-journey">My Journey</h2>

        <p class="hero__bio">
            I discovered my passion for software back in 2023, when I began learning Python
            and ended up writing a script to automate stock pricing at Elite Vision. Seeing
            that script create a measurable, optimised workflow — that project was the
            catalyst that defined my continuing developer journey.
        </p>

        <p class="hero__bio">
            Since then I have coded voraciously before and after work, exploring a handful of
            different technologies. My self-driven learning has culminated in completing
            Northcoders’ Enterprise Engineering course.
        </p>

        @if (ShowMore)
        {
            <p class="hero__bio">
                Before making the switch, I spent over a decade in customer-facing roles,
                starting with barbering, then moving into the Optics field as an Optical
                Assistant for Specsavers and later as a Lab Technician with Elite Vision
                Therapy Center in Toronto, Canada.
            </p>

            <p class="hero__bio">
                Across all of these roles I built a foundation in client consultation,
                problem solving, working under pressure and working with precision. All of
                these are skills that carry over well into developer roles.
            </p>

            <p class="hero__bio">
                Since picking up code, I’ve explored a broad range of tools and platforms.
                I’ve built Android applications using Jetpack Compose, multiplatform projects
                in Kotlin backed by a Spring Boot API, and C# applications using the .NET
                framework with Blazor on the frontend. Currently, I’m developing my React
                skills to round out my toolkit with one of the most in-demand technologies
                on the market.
            </p>
        }

        <button type="button" class="btn-link hero__bio-toggle" @onclick="() => ShowMore = !ShowMore">
            @(ShowMore ? "Show less" : "Show more...")
        </button>
    </div>

    <div class="hero__photo">
        <img src="img/sam.png" alt="Sam Dukes"/>
    </div>
</section>

@code {
    private bool ShowMore { get; set; }
}
